<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 6 Discussion ‣ OptiLeak: Efficient Prompt Reconstruction via Reinforcement Learning in Multi-tenant LLM Services" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Deploying <span class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_smallcaps">OptiLeak</span> as a Cache-based Side Channel Risk Assessment Tool.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
